## 5. What you may not do

Except as section 4 allows, or with the Author's prior written permission, you may not:

- copy, reproduce, or republish any work, in whole or in part;
- distribute, sell, sublicense, or otherwise make any work available to others;
- adapt, translate, or create derivative works from any Original Work, or from the Author's own contributions to a Fan Work;
- use any work, or any part of one, for a commercial purpose;
- present any work, or any part of one, as your own;
- include any work in a dataset, or use it to train, fine-tune, or evaluate a machine learning or artificial intelligence system.

These restrictions cover the Author's own contributions only. Your use of Third-Party Material is governed by its owners' terms, not by this licence.

